2026-10-15T13:00:05.1627241Z   Kobo Duplicate Provenance & Expected Arrivals Contracts (Issue #146)
2026-10-15T13:00:05.1628494Z     ✓ 1. Intra-submission duplicate barcodes are admitted safely without unique constraint crash, preserving duplicate depth provenance in metadata and AuditLog (35 ms)
2026-10-15T13:00:05.1629395Z     ✓ 2. Cross-submission duplicate barcode preserves conflicting field provenance and audit trail without discarding differences (19 ms)
2026-10-15T13:00:05.1630023Z     ✓ 3. Empty submission response updates lastSyncAt to prevent rapid polling spinning (4 ms)
2026-10-15T13:00:05.1630547Z     ✓ 4. Full idempotency on repeat sync with identical submissions (11 ms)
2026-10-15T13:00:05.1631263Z     ✓ 5. Foreign sample collision strictly avoids mutation, reports FOREIGN_SCOPE_COLLISION, and halts cursor (7 ms)
2026-10-15T13:00:05.1632328Z     ✓ 6. Duplicate branch enforces commit gates and rolls back transaction on revoked config (33 ms)
2026-10-15T13:00:05.1633112Z     ✓ 7. Conflict replay idempotency: repeating the conflicting submission does not append duplicate entries or duplicate audit rows (20 ms)
2026-10-15T13:00:05.1633994Z     ✓ 8. Case-insensitive lookup preserves evidence on lowercase existing record in DB, advancing cursor cleanly (8 ms)
2026-10-15T13:00:05.1634945Z     ✓ 9. Ambiguous depth identity retains a durable hold through physical arrival and blocks acceptance (54 ms)
2026-10-15T13:00:05.1635514Z     ✓ 10. Unchanged original primary replay causes zero metadata, audit, or hold changes (9 ms)
2026-10-15T13:00:05.1636165Z     ✓ 11. Cross-form occurrences with same kobo_id and depth are preserved and not silently deduplicated (14 ms)
2026-10-15T13:00:05.1636821Z     ✓ 12. Unknown ownership and historical samples (REJECTED/RECEIVED) are protected from mutation (17 ms)
2026-10-15T13:00:05.1637617Z     ✓ 13. Real isolated reception intake and consignment routes block AMBIGUOUS_PROVENANCE_HOLD with HTTP 409, while normal sample succeeds (49 ms)
2026-10-15T13:00:05.1638257Z     ✓ 14. SampleWorkspaceService blocks canAcceptIntake when AMBIGUOUS_PROVENANCE_HOLD is active (11 ms)
2026-10-15T13:00:05.1638962Z     ✓ 15. Source-B primary record does not suppress source-A submission with same ID and depth (Finding 1) (9 ms)
2026-10-15T13:00:05.1639659Z     ✓ 16. Primary occurrence replayed with changed coordinates or attachments creates revision hold (Finding 2) (14 ms)
2026-10-15T13:00:05.1640315Z     ✓ 17. Conflicting occurrence replayed with changed coordinates preserves revision append-only (18 ms)
