2026-10-15T13:09:14.5386901Z   WP-B: Unified Action and Scope Model
2026-10-15T13:09:14.5387294Z     1. Unified Action and Resource Policy Resolver (actionPolicyService)
2026-10-15T13:09:14.5388018Z       ✓ Super Admin can manage any user and any lab (1 ms)
2026-10-15T13:09:14.5388513Z       ✓ Lab Manager can manage subordinate in own lab, but not in another lab (1 ms)
2026-10-15T13:09:14.5389008Z       ✓ Lab Manager cannot manage peer manager or project manager
2026-10-15T13:09:14.5389687Z       ✓ Lab Manager cannot elevate technician to manager role
2026-10-15T13:09:14.5390130Z       ✓ Self-role change is rejected with SELF_MANAGEMENT_FORBIDDEN
2026-10-15T13:09:14.5390569Z       ✓ Inactive actor is denied with ACTOR_INACTIVE
2026-10-15T13:09:14.5390991Z     2. Project-to-Lab Canonical Membership Resolver (projectMembershipService)
2026-10-15T13:09:14.5391592Z       ✓ resolveProjectLabs correctly identifies owner and servicing laboratories (3 ms)
2026-10-15T13:09:14.5392280Z       ✓ getDiscrepancyReport scans database and returns audit report without data loss (3 ms)
2026-10-15T13:09:14.5392975Z       ✓ canManageProject allows owner lab manager and super admin; denies non-owner manager (1 ms)
2026-10-15T13:09:14.5393756Z     3. Assignable Roles Server Catalogue (GET /api/access/assignable-roles)
2026-10-15T13:09:14.5394306Z       ✓ Super Admin gets all 10 roles in assignableRoles (9 ms)
2026-10-15T13:09:14.5394994Z       ✓ Lab Manager gets only ALLOWED_SUB_ROLES and sees peer/admin roles as unmanageable with reasons (9 ms)
2026-10-15T13:09:14.5395715Z       ✓ Ordinary viewer is denied access to assignable-roles (403 Forbidden) (15 ms)
2026-10-15T13:09:14.5396307Z       ✓ GET /api/access/capabilities returns platform role capabilities (8 ms)
2026-10-15T13:09:14.5396740Z     4. Work Assignment Eligibility & Validation (A23, LG-17, A33)
2026-10-15T13:09:14.5397353Z       ✓ A23: Assignment to deactivated technician is rejected with ASSIGNEE_INACTIVE (400) (34 ms)
2026-10-15T13:09:14.5397938Z       ✓ A23: Assignment to technician in different lab is rejected with 403 (7 ms)
2026-10-15T13:09:14.5398479Z       ✓ A23: Assignment in paused/inactive lab is rejected with LAB_PAUSED (400) (12 ms)
2026-10-15T13:09:14.5399170Z       ✓ GET /api/work/eligible-assignees returns active analytical staff and excludes deactivated staff (7 ms)
2026-10-15T13:09:14.5399740Z     5. Staff Directory Scoping & Bounded Pagination (LG-08, LG-22)
2026-10-15T13:09:14.5400334Z       ✓ LG-08: National user directory is strictly scoped to labs in authorized country (6 ms)
2026-10-15T13:09:14.5401046Z       ✓ LG-08: National user with empty country scope receives empty array (not global leak) (4 ms)
2026-10-15T13:09:14.5401726Z       ✓ GET /api/users/directory?purpose=assignment filters to active analytical staff (5 ms)
2026-10-15T13:09:14.5402442Z       ✓ GET /api/users enforces bounded pagination (clamps excessive limit to 100) and excludes password (7 ms)
